# Daily Attendance Check Crontab Example
#
# Runs Monday through Friday (or daily) at 16:05 (4:05 PM local time, 5 mins past cutoff).
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Edit the path below to match your repository directory and virtualenv.
# 2. Add to your user crontab with: crontab -e
#
# Format:
# m h  dom mon dow   command

# Run daily at 16:05 local time (covers Monday-Sunday)
# Student confirmation ('I WENT TO COLLEGE') acts as the primary safety gate;
# if unconfirmed on any day (including weekends), the run exits cleanly with NO_ACTION.
5 16 * * * cd /REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ROOT && /REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ROOT/.venv/bin/python /REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ROOT/scripts/run_daily_check.py >> /REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ROOT/logs/daily_check.log 2>&1

